  "text": "took 3wks to finally kicked in and do its job.\nAnxiety.\nShakiness and weakness of arms and legs.\nBurning/heat sensation on back.\nMalaise.\nNausea.\nAnd recently added to my dilemma, trapped gas which gives dyspepsia like pain, pelvic pain, kidney pain.\nWhat made me sure it is trapped gas is I felt relieved after belching and tooting!\n(sorry)\ntook a while to work its purpose.\nIf people respond to tums, gaviscon, mylanta and such, stay away from this med.\nI dont intend to stay on this med too long!\nI hope I can wean myself when acid reflux is totally controlled and will respond to antacid.\n",
